{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:52 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07125a515f50226e3372294479dd0b76/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_20_51_21.jpeg\"/>\n<p>🏇 賽馬迷絕對不能錯過！萬眾期待的「莎莎婦女銀袋」焦點賽事即將開戰，星級主持陣容陪你一同見證精彩激戰，全城投入時尚與速度的狂熱！</p>\n<p>📅 日期：2026年11月8日（星期日）</p>\n<p>⏰ 時間：12:00 開始（可於節目前10-15分鐘入場）</p>\n<p>📍 地點：葵涌榮芳路3號守運大廈一樓5號舖</p>\n<p>💰 費用：$188/位（成功報名後將會有專人聯絡安排付款事宜）</p>\n<p>🎤 星級主持陣容：</p>\n<p>亨利 ＋ LingLing ＋ 韋少 陪你睇足全日賽事，現場互動、賽前專業分析、焦點直擊莎莎婦女銀袋，一次過滿足你所有願望！</p>\n<p>📝 立即報名：名額有限，火速行動！網友可在此 Post 留言或直接私訊報名，稍後有專人聯絡入數詳情；或登入以下連結報名：<br/>🔗 https://forms.gle/ML2koRyxSXjvH4My5</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3db6dbccc6d03ea7dd0f3dbde0e88036/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_20_51_21_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ff02637213081a48e3f479aeb942e24/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_20_51_21_0.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T13:28:24.404970+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":367,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T16:58:32.106696+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T13:25:43.570004+00:00","content_hash":"c311f57cf877a00fa4c9f5b7cd06d7932551b713529f97063eda69348ed64134","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}